  "lineLimit": ["^(?:you\\s+)?(?:must\\s+)?(?:always\\s+)?(?:answer|respond|reply)\\s+(?:concisely\\s+)?with\\s+(exactly|at most|no more than|fewer than|less than)\\s+(one|[0-9]+)\\s+lines?(?:\\s+of\\s+text)?(?:\\s+(\\(not including tool use or code generation\\)))?(?:,\\s+(unless (?:the )?user asks for detail))?$"],
